@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title MLMS - Sequence: Submit assignment (UC-01, incl. late and resubmission paths)
actor Student
participant ConsoleUI
participant SubmissionService as SS
participant PermissionPolicy as PP
participant DeadlineResolver as DR
participant LatePenaltyPolicy as LP
participant ISubmissionRepository as SR
participant AuditService as AS
participant TransactionManager as TX
Student -> ConsoleUI : 2. Submit (assignmentId, content)
ConsoleUI -> SS : submit(student, assignmentId, content)
SS -> PP : require(SubmitWork); requireEnrolled(courseId)
SS -> DR : resolve(assignment, studentId)
DR --> SS : DeadlineInfo(effective)
SS -> LP : lateDays(now, effective)
LP --> SS : lateDays
SS -> SR : find(assignmentId, studentId)
alt first submission
  SS -> TX : run
  activate TX
  SS -> SR : create(status = lateDays > 0 ? LATE : SUBMITTED)
  SS -> SR : addVersion(submittedAt, content)
  SS -> AS : record(SUBMISSION_RECORDED)
  deactivate TX
else resubmission before deadline and unmarked
  SS -> TX : run
  activate TX
  SS -> SR : addVersion(...) (old versions kept, latest flagged)
  SS -> AS : record(SUBMISSION_RECORDED, "Resubmission")
  deactivate TX
else resubmission after deadline or already marked
  SS --> ConsoleUI : throw RuleViolation
  ConsoleUI --> Student : [!] Resubmission is only allowed before the deadline
end
SS --> ConsoleUI : SubmitResult(version, status, lateDays)
ConsoleUI --> Student : [OK] Submitted ... status LATE, 3 day(s) late
note over SS, TX : If any step throws, the transaction rolls back\nand no success message is shown (E3).
@enduml
